				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.26
			</span></i>; <i>suffering from convulsions</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.88
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς</span>. <i>attacks of
